{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a mind-controlling virus, the infected\u2014known as the Plagued\u2014roam as violent, uncontrollable monsters. The Vanguard were a band of heroes with one sworn purpose: A promise to eradicate this world of the Plagued. As the last surviving member of the Vanguard, Remi journeys to fulfill that promise, even if it means encountering familiar faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, combat-driven journey of duty, loss, and resolve awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bleak post-apocalyptic world as Remi, cutting through hordes of Plagued enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful enemies and bosses that challenge your ability as a player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by leveling up Remi\u2019s combat abilities through battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden relics that assist you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lore of the world and its fallen heroes through in-game entries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo developer passion project.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Begin Another Cycle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4083200/13afa3623891505035f66975cdc22261d11963d9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Ian The Professor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4083200/13afa3623891505035f66975cdc22261d11963d9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Aria The Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4083200/13afa3623891505035f66975cdc22261d11963d9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Alden the Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4083200/13afa3623891505035f66975cdc22261d11963d9.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/p